# Implementation Plan - Sidebar History Feature

Add a search history feature to the sidebar that stores and displays recent search queries in a "latest to older" order (LIFO stack behavior).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - History will be stored in **MongoDB** for persistence and cross-device availability.
> - A new `History` model will be created on the backend.
> - History will be retrieved in "latest to oldest" order based on the `createdAt` timestamp.

## Proposed Changes

### [NEW] Backend Components
#### [NEW] [history.model.js](file:///c:/Users/KIIT0001/Desktop/Smart-search/Backend/src/models/history.model.js)
- Schema with `userId` (ref User), `query`, `type` (e.g., 'search'), and `timestamp`.
- Indexes for performance on `userId` and `createdAt`.

#### [NEW] [history.controller.js](file:///c:/Users/KIIT0001/Desktop/Smart-search/Backend/src/controllers/history.controller.js)
